---
title: Edit content
# The form for one seminar or event: /app/content/edit/?type=seminar for a new
# one, ?id=… to change one. Publishing saves it and rebuilds the site.
permalink: /app/content/edit/
appTab: content-new
noindex: true
excludeFromSitemap: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
seoTitle: 'Edit content | AI Safety for Italy'
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero meet-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Site content</span>
    <h1 id="pageTitle">New seminar</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="meet-main">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "content-bar.njk" %}
    <div class="notice" id="deletedNotice" hidden style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <span><strong>Removed from the site.</strong> Saving, or restoring a version below, puts it back.</span>
    </div>

    <form id="contentForm" novalidate hidden>
      <div class="content-layout">
        <div class="panel form-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="form-label" id="typeLabel">Type</span>
            <div class="choice-group" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="typeLabel" id="typeChoices">
              <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="type" value="seminar"><span>Seminar</span></label>
              <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="type" value="event"><span>Event</span></label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="day">Day</label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="day" name="day" type="date" required>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="time">Time <span class="panel-note">(Italian time)</span></label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="time" name="time" type="time" step="300">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="end_time">Ends at <span class="panel-note">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="end_time" name="end_time" type="time" step="300">
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="check-row">
            <input type="checkbox" id="tbc" name="tbc">
            <span>Still to be confirmed <span class="panel-note">· title greyed out, “coming soon” in the calendar</span></span>
          </label>
          <div>
            <label class="form-label" for="speaker">Speaker <span class="panel-note">(name shown in the calendar)</span></label>
            <input class="form-input is-compact" id="speaker" name="speaker" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Carlo Martinucci">
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="title">Title</label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="title" name="title" maxlength="200">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="title_it">Title in Italian</label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="title_it" name="title_it" maxlength="200">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="md-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="description_md">Description</label>
            <textarea class="form-input is-compact md-input" id="description_md" name="description_md" maxlength="8000" rows="7"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="md-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="description_md_it">Description in Italian</label>
            <textarea class="form-input is-compact md-input" id="description_md_it" name="description_md_it" maxlength="8000" rows="7"></textarea>
          </div>
          <p class="form-note">**bold** · *italic* · [link text](https://…) · a line starting with “- ” makes a list · an empty line starts a new paragraph. A speaker bio can go at the end, e.g. “**About the speaker.** …”.</p>

          <div>
            <span class="form-label">Details</span>
            <p class="form-note" style="margin:0 0 .5rem">The list under the description: speaker and affiliation, where, who it is for…</p>
            <div id="details"></div>
            <div class="wk-nav" style="margin-top:.5rem">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-preset="speaker">+ Speaker</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-preset="where">+ Where</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-preset="">+ Other</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="form-label" for="register_link">Registration link <span class="panel-note">(optional, e.g. Luma)</span></label>
            <input class="form-input is-compact" id="register_link" name="register_link" type="url" maxlength="500" placeholder="https://luma.com/…">
          </div>
          <div class="form-row" id="registerTexts">
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="register_text">Button text</label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="register_text" name="register_text" maxlength="80" placeholder="Register for free on Luma">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="form-label" for="register_text_it">Button text in Italian</label>
              <input class="form-input is-compact" id="register_text_it" name="register_text_it" maxlength="80" placeholder="Registrazione gratuita su Luma">
            </div>
          </div>

          <details class="past-fields" id="pastFields">
            <summary>Description after the event <span class="panel-note">(optional)</span></summary>
            <p class="form-note">From the day after, the card moves to “Past” and shows this text instead, without the registration button. Write it in the past tense; left empty, the description above stays.</p>
            <div class="md-field">
              <label class="form-label" for="description_past_md">After the event</label>
              <textarea class="form-input is-compact md-input" id="description_past_md" name="description_past_md" maxlength="8000" rows="5"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="md-field">
              <label class="form-label" for="description_past_md_it">After the event, in Italian</label>
              <textarea class="form-input is-compact md-input" id="description_past_md_it" name="description_past_md_it" maxlength="8000" rows="5"></textarea>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="content-side">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-head">
              <h2>Preview</h2>
              <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Preview language">
                <button type="button" data-lang="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button>
                <button type="button" data-lang="it" aria-pressed="false">IT</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="content-preview" id="preview" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <p class="form-error" id="previewError" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="panel" id="historyPanel" hidden>
            <div class="panel-head"><h2>History</h2></div>
            <ul class="activity-list" id="history"></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-error" id="formError" role="alert" hidden style="margin-top:1.25rem"></div>

      <div class="action-bar">
        <p id="saveNote">Goes online on the site in about 3 minutes.</p>
        <div class="wk-nav">
          <button class="btn btn-danger-outline" type="button" id="deleteBtn" hidden>Remove from the site</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="saveBtn">Publish</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>
    <div id="formState"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/meet/common.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/app-common.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/markdown-lite.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/content-common.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/content-edit.js" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
